      "lines": "106-112",
      "status": "read; verbatim from current source",
      "quote": "noncomputable def toRootedRegion (s : ConnectedSupport) : RootedRegion where\n  root := s.root\n  member := fun v => v \u2208 s.first :: s.rest\n  root_mem := s.root_mem\n  below := fun v hv => walk_below_minimum (s.connected _ s.root_mem v hv) s.root_shortest\n  convex := fun x y hrx hxy hy =>\n    walk_ancestor_between (s.connected _ s.root_mem y hy) x hrx hxy"
    },
    {
      "source": "research/rmaf/bridge_review/lean/GraphRegion.lean",
