      "lines": "123-127",
      "status": "read; verbatim from current source",
      "quote": "theorem deepest_graph_root_in_neighbor (a b : ConnectedSupport)\n    (hdepth : b.root.length \u2264 a.root.length)\n    (hoverlap : \u2203 z, z \u2208 a.first :: a.rest \u2227 z \u2208 b.first :: b.rest) :\n    a.root \u2208 b.first :: b.rest := by\n  exact PureBridge.deepest_root_in_neighbor a.toRootedRegion b.toRootedRegion hdepth hoverlap"
    },
    {
      "source": "research/rmaf/pure_bridge/lean/PureBridge.lean",
      "sha256": "acf08329466b6449c39c5edb0914c7af15f30690b25b8f0389cb65b2b24943f4",
      "lines": "14-19",
      "status": "read; verbatim from current source",
      "quote": "structure RootedRegion where\n  root : Address\n  member : Address \u2192 Prop\n  root_mem : member root\n  below : \u2200 v, member v \u2192 root.IsPrefix v\n  convex : \u2200 x y, root.IsPrefix x \u2192 x.IsPrefix y \u2192 member y \u2192 member x"
    },
